  "prefLabel": "Env-C 202.15 Record hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 202.15 “Record hearing” means:\n\n(a) For purposes of an adjudicative proceeding, the submittal by the participants of written testimony, evidence, and arguments prior to a specified deadline; or\n\n(b) For purposes of a non-adjudicative proceeding, the submittal by an applicant, a permittee, and/or the public, as applicable to the proceeding, of information relating to the subject of the proceeding in writing on paper or by e-mail.\n\nSource. #8851-A, eff 3-25-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-c200.html"
